# The populated graph and the artifact store are GENERATED runtime state and
# stay uncommitted. `D-32` (Dave, 2026-08-15) governs producer OUTPUT — a
# populated store, anything whose presence removes the need to produce it —
# and `D-IMPL-163` (Dave, 2026-08-20) narrows it to exactly that: a declared
# INPUT document a program interprets is not what `D-32` forbids. This
# deployment's declared input lives in `../runner/signal-batch.yaml`, and
# `../runner/seed.py` produces the three names below from it through the
# fabric's single writer (`D-IMPL-245` amendment 2, Dave, 2026-09-03).
#
# They are named here so that a developer who has run the seed cannot commit
# what it produced by accident, which is the difference between a rule and a
# mechanism.
graph.sqlite3
graph.sqlite3-*
artifact-store/
